        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nate Albert, Rod Stewart\n- Organizations: Capitol Records, Universal Music Group, The Mighty Mighty Bosstones\n- Roles: music executive, songwriter, producer, guitar player, Executive Vice President of A&R, rock singer\n- Works: Back to the World\n\nFacts:\n- Rod Stewart was born on 10 January 1945 and is a British rock singer and songwriter.\n- Nate Albert was born in 1970 and is an American music executive, songwriter, producer, and guitar player.\n- Nate Albert is currently the Executive Vice President of A&R at Capitol Records, a division of Universal Music Group.\n- Nate Albert was formerly a member of The Mighty Mighty Bosstones.\n- The album Back to the World was produced by Nate Albert.",
